<title>USA: MRI Medical stockholders okay purchase.</title>
<headline>MRI Medical stockholders okay purchase.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>MRI Medical Diagnostics Inc Tuesday said its board and shareholders have approved an acquisition and a one-for-five reverse common stock split.</p>
<p>MRI Medical is acquiring Alpine Herbs and Nutrition Inc, a Nevada company, for four million post-split shares. Alpine owns global distribution and franchise rights for nutritional products made by Alpine Herbs Products AG in Switzerland. It makes over 90 topical creams, lotions and ointments.</p>
<p>Following the split, MRI Medical's issued and outstanding will total just over 12.5 million including the four million shares issued to Alpine.</p>
</text>
